---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Read the Home Cleaning Services privacy policy for information about enquiry data, website usage, service communication, and privacy practices in Singapore."
>
  <section class="container py-14 md:py-20">
    <h1 class="serif max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] text-ink md:text-7xl">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-ink/68">
      This Privacy Policy explains how Home Cleaning Services may collect, use, and protect information shared through this
      website. Review it before connecting live form handling, payments, analytics, or advertising tools.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container max-w-4xl space-y-10 pb-20 text-ink/72">
    <div>
      <h2 class="serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">Information we collect</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        We may collect information you choose to provide, such as your name, contact details, requested service, property type,
        preferred date, and enquiry message. We may also collect basic website usage information if analytics or security tools
        are added to the site.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">How we use information</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        We may use information to respond to enquiries, prepare cleaning quotes, arrange service details, improve website content,
        and keep the site secure and reliable.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">Sharing information</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        We do not sell personal information. Information may be shared with service providers only where needed to respond to
        an enquiry, operate the website, arrange cleaning services, comply with legal obligations, or protect legitimate interests.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">Retention and security</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        We should keep enquiry information only for as long as needed for service, administrative, legal, or business purposes.
        We should also take reasonable steps to protect information from unauthorised access, misuse, loss, or disclosure.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">Your choices</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        You may request access, correction, or deletion of personal information where applicable. If a live contact channel is
        added to this site, privacy requests should be sent through that channel.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">Updates</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        This policy may be updated as the website, services, form handling, analytics, or legal requirements change. The latest
        version belongs on this page.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
